# Engine runtime state. These are local facts about one working tree:
# evidence, verdicts and caches. They are never committed, never packed into a
# context bundle, and never used as evidence on another machine.
state/
evidence/
receipts/
waivers/

# trend/ is deliberately NOT ignored: the architecture-debt ledger is a shared
# team fact, and the ratchet only works if everyone measures against the same best.
